<v Speaker 1>it's Van Lunen's untap step and he has 12 cards left in his library. The Russian just five. In Van Lunen's upkeep. Potvin casts Mistbind Clique to tap down Van Lunen's lands. Jacob drew his seven for the turn and moved to discount. By this point, as you can imagine, Posavina had plenty of manner to work with. So when Van Lunen passed the turn, it was time for the Russian to go to work. 3 Manor casts Pestermite. Tap your howling mine. And yes, before you ask,</v>

